Right now click here for all my season 4 countdown
videos and click here to learn about the first

00:06:36.719 --> 00:06:38.759
couple of episodes this season.

00:06:38.759 --> 00:06:39.759
And winds of winter.

00:06:39.759 --> 00:06:42.090
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

